/**
 * The game-checkout line "Includes N Cyrus tokens (+M every renewal) · Beta, Minecraft Java".
 * GATED: until cyrus_tok_live, only private-preview accounts get a line (and never while
 * impersonating); everyone else gets a plain 404 and the checkout renders nothing.
